  "description": "Tamp CommandPlan wrappers for the Nuclei vulnerability scanner (MIT, ProjectDiscovery). Template-driven scanning plus DAST/fuzzing templates and OpenAPI/Swagger input, with native SARIF export for the Tamp security pipeline. Single static Go binary — no runtime dependencies. Typed severity and input-mode enums, Secret-aware header handling, and secret-file support for authenticated scans.",
